OL,3,Vupppppp5CWednesday
OL,5,G0130 Light and Dark
OL,6,     F1/2. Professor Jim Al-Khalili
OL,7,     Fshows how mathematicians and
OL,8,     Fscientists such as Euclid, Galileo
OL,9,     Fand Ole Roemer have used light to
OL,10,     Freveal almost everything we know
OL,11,     Fabout the universe.
OL,12,G0230 The Planets
OL,13,     F2/5. Professor Brian Cox continues
OL,14,     Fhis tour of the solar system,
OL,15,     Frevealing that it was once home to
OL,16,     Fnot one, but two blue planets.
